":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"decision_heading_order\",\"description\":\"exact ordered level-two headings\",\"status\":\"fail\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"decision_source_breadth\",\"description\":\"13 distinct cited sources\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"decision_title\",\"description\":\"exact decision title\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"decision_word_range\",\"description\":\"word_count=2092; required=1500-2100\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"ledger_heading\",\"description\":\"exact task-native ledger heading\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"ledger_source_breadth\",\"description\":\"14 distinct cited sources\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"power_duration_reversal\",\"description\":\"no unnegated prohibited relation conversion\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"pressure_unit_reversal\",\"description\":\"no prohibited relation conversion\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"probability_measure_reversal\",\"description\":\"no prohibited relation conversion\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"self_authorized_readiness\",\"description\":\"no prohibited relation conversion\",\"status\":\"pass\"},{\"criterion_id\":\"threshold_reversal\",\"description\":\"no prohibited relation conversion\",\"status\":\"pass\"}],\"evaluated_candidate_sha256\":\"56dbd283bef7636af26b7cad3d0fcbf11b3b6421664fb77dee67cced063e254d\",\"evaluator_id\":\"solace-water-evaluator-v1\",\"passed\":false,\"raw_result_handle\":\"raw-tool://RESULT-020/evaluator\",\"raw_result_preserved_exactly\":true,\"returncode_class\":\"zero\",\"schema\":\"stable-candidate-bound-check-projection-v1\",\"volatile_fields_excluded\":true}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"patch_decision\",\"edits\":[{\"new\":\"The restoration gate requires at least 35 psi at every critical node for three consecutive thirty-minute windows; the current 42 psi reading does not by itself satisfy this multi-window requirement, and psi values must not be converted to kPa or treated as proof of water quality [BASTION]. Ridge storage contains 5.8 million gallons, while the twelve-hour emergency reserve is 3.2 million gallons; these are distinct measures and must not be conflated as treated reserve [BASTION]. DELTA pump sequencing depends on BASTION pressure and ECHO power; cavitation constraints limit shared-main capacity under staged demand conditions [DELTA, BASTION, ECHO]. Pressure warnings at 38 psi and isolation triggers at 30 psi are distinct control states: a warning does not initiate isolation, and an isolation trigger does not merely warn [INDIGO, BASTION]. Residence time in the distribution loop must be verified against candidate-bound hydraulic model H12; any change to valve map V8 or controller firmware C11 invalidates prior residence-time evidence [MOSAIC]. The current minimum pressure of 42 psi exceeds the 30 psi isolation trigger but remains within the operational band defined by H12; no isolation action is currently indicated, though the three-consecutive-window restoration gate must still be met before hydraulic clearance can be claimed [BASTION, INDIGO].\",\"old\":\"The north-zone distribution system currently holds a minimum pressure of 42 psi [BASTION]. The restoration gate requires at least 35 psi at every critical node for three consecutive thirty-minute windows; the current 42 psi reading does not by itself satisfy this multi-window requirement, and psi values must not be converted to kPa or treated as proof of water quality [BASTION]. Ridge storage contains 5.8 million gallons, while the twelve-hour emergency reserve is 3.2 million gallons; these are distinct measures and must not be conflated as treated reserve [BASTION]. DELTA pump sequencing depends on BASTION pressure and ECHO power; cavitation constraints limit shared-main capacity under staged demand conditions [DELTA, BASTION, ECHO]. Pressure warnings at 38 psi and isolation triggers at 30 psi are distinct control states: a warning does not initiate isolation, and an isolation trigger does not merely warn [INDIGO, BASTION]. Residence time in the distribution loop must be verified against candidate-bound hydraulic model H12; any change to valve map V8 or controller firmware C11 invalidates prior residence-time evidence [MOSAIC]. The current minimum pressure of 42 psi exceeds the 30 psi isolation trigger but remains within the operational band defined by H12; no isolation action is currently indicated, though the three-consecutive-window restoration gate must still be met before hydraulic clearance can be claimed [BASTION, INDIGO].\"},{\"new\":\"The shared transmission main is capped at 14.5 mgd, and pump nameplate capacities cannot be summed into usable system flow; the latest inspected configuration sustained 12.8 MGD after fire-flow and hospital reserve [DELTA]. Restoration may advance through 10, 30, 60, and 100 percent demand stages only after two consecutive thirty-minute windows meet pressure, turbidity, power, and storage gates [DELTA].\",\"old\":\"The shared transmission main is capped at 14.5 million gallons per day, and pump nameplate capacities cannot be summed into usable system flow; the latest inspected configuration sustained 12.8 MGD after fire-flow and hospital reserve [DELTA]. Restoration may advance through ten, thirty, sixty, and one hundred percent demand stages only after two consecutive thirty-minute windows meet pressure, turbidity, power, and storage gates [DELTA].\"}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v010:33ebe09b9e9d9f0d52457c0feb8067076ae7b3d01c70bdee5b2c899dfbf2dcf6\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-021\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"33ebe09b9e9d9f0d52457c0feb8067076ae7b3d01c70bdee5b2c899dfbf2dcf6\",\"before_sha256\":\"56dbd283bef7636af26b7cad3d0fcbf11b3b6421664fb77dee67cced063e254d\",\"candidat